          "value": "<p>You slam biotic energy into the ground, sending a rolling kinetic shockwave along the surface that topples everything in its path.</p><p>All creatures in a @Template[line|distance:60]{60-foot line} must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:resolve(13+@actor.system.details.level.value+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/3))|options:me-power:me-npc-biotic-shockwave] save against the creature's power DC.</p><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> Unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(1*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[(2*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage and is pushed 10 feet away from you.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but @Damage[(4*(1+floor(@actor.system.details.level.value/4)))d6[bludgeoning]] damage and also <strong>Knocked Prone</strong>.</p><p><strong>Recharge</strong> The creature can't use this power again for [[/br 1d4 #Recharge]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><hr/><p><em>NPC version. Its DC is 13 + level + a third of level (the moderate DC for the creature's level), and its damage dice multiply every 4 levels. When a creature rolls the save, the result is applied automatically (see the Auto-Apply Power Effects setting).</em></p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
